MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 436701554}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6b3f2380d333b26489f2c02fc6963167, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  icon: {fileID: -291290543, guid: f0c26bf80f32c1d4abd4aa483e8c0dab, type: 3}
  itemName: Scroll
  itemType: 1
  itemPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  scrollContent: 'Stranger drawn to the light...

    Do you know why No Color Land
    lost its light?


    We were the village entrusted with the final light of the
    gods.

    But an unknown creature came... and stole it away.

    Now we live
    in darkness, punished for our failure.


    Many have tried. All have failed.

    Will
    you be the one to save us?


    This is your last chance to walk away.


    (PS.
    I leave this behind... in hopes of saving even one more soul.)'
